  "notes": "Fair bulk-email preview remains governed by fair_emails.read plus mail-template read/render permissions and no longer fails because SMTP account read is unavailable. SMTP account discovery is treated as optional supporting data for send configuration: without email_accounts.read, the account lookup and picker are omitted and send remains fail closed. Backend preview/send authorization is unchanged."
